&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You will own the platform that makes AI systems at&amp;nbsp;Mitratech&amp;nbsp;measurable, observable, governable, and production ready. The role combines platform engineering, applied AI quality, incident ownership, and practical governance implementation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
