&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is explicitly a hands-on leadership role. The team begins small —&amp;nbsp;likely one&amp;nbsp;to two direct reports — and you are expected to spend&amp;nbsp;roughly half&amp;nbsp;of your time writing and reviewing production code while the organization scales. Near-term success depends on a leader who wants to build as well as manage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
